            <note corresp="#d1077-f2" n="90" xml:id="d1077-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram No. 1917, September 13, 11 a.m., <ref target="#pg1342">p.
                    1342</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1077-f3" n="91" xml:id="d1077-f3-content">
                <p>See footnote 70, <ref target="#pg1341">p. 1341</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1077-f4" n="92" xml:id="d1077-f4-content">
                <p>Telegram No. 2343, October 3, 3 p.m., from the Consul General at Shanghai, <ref
                        target="#pg1350">p. 1350</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1077-f5" n="93" xml:id="d1077-f5-content">
                <p>The agreement was signed on behalf of China by Dr. Liu Shih-shun, Political Vice
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
